Two fields of a nested struct the source has and the target lacks, which the
lens's body for the struct neither maps nor drops: one diagnostic at that
body, whose help drops both in it.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	meta: {
		owner:  string
		legacy: string
		shadow: string
	}
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	meta: {
		owner: string
	}
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		meta: {
			owner: v0_0.meta.owner
		}
	}
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	meta: {
		owner: string
	}
}
-- out/error --
error[E0347]: v0.0 declares meta.legacy and meta.shadow, which v1.0 does not, and nothing maps them
  --> history/1.0.thema:10:3
   |
10 |         meta: {
   |         ^^^^
   |
   = help: write <field>: v0_0.meta.legacy, <field>: v0_0.meta.shadow to move them, or add legacy: _drop, shadow: _drop to v1_0.meta
